      "insight": "Readers engage with Polygon not as a monolithic bet but as a split identity — institutional TradFi partners (central banks, Franklin Templeton, FIFA) are arriving just as DeFi's anchor tenant (Aave) is threatening to walk, exposing a chain that is winning enterprise credibility while losing the DeFi liquidity that justified its valuation.",
